OL,3,GNEWSAJustice minister says lessons must
OL,4,Abe learned from on-the-run killer case
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice Minister Naomi Long has said it
OL,7,Fis "critical that the criminal justice
OL,8,Fsystem learns from the events" around
OL,9,Fthe handling of the compassionate
OL,10,Ftemporary release application by Gary
OL,11,FAnderson "to avoid any retraumatisation
OL,12,Fof victims".
OL,14,FShe has published the terms of
OL,15,Freference for an independent review
OL,16,Finto the circumstances of his release.
OL,18,FAnderson, 29, who was convicted of
OL,19,Fmurder, was unlawfully at large for
OL,20,Fmore than a week before he was arrested
OL,21,Fin the Republic of Ireland on 23
OL,22,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
