OL,3,GNEWSAJustice minister says lessons must
OL,4,Abe learned from on-the-run killer case
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was jailed for life in 2023,
OL,7,Falongside his brother, for the murder
OL,8,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry. He was
OL,9,Fon temporary release from prison to
OL,10,Fattend his father's funeral when he
OL,11,Fabsconded.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
